--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRESERVED UPSTREAM ASSETS & COMPATIBILITY SPECIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following upstream Coolify assets and compatibility contracts are preserved:
- One-click Docker Compose service catalog & YAML templates (templates/)
- Service icons and brand assets copied into the standalone shell (svgs/)
- Compose parser golden reference fixtures (tests/Fixtures/parser/)
- PostgreSQL v4 relational data model and id = 0 instance sentinel semantics
- Bidirectional Laravel APP_KEY AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 secret encryption
  and Sanctum-compatible Bearer token / MCP contract
- Product UI design tokens and security threat model (DESIGN.md, SECURITY.md)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GOOLIFY RE-ARCHITECTURE (Worachote Pansanit, 2026)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Substantial modifications and standalone native implementations authored for
Goolify include:
- backend/   — Go 1.26 control plane, durable PostgreSQL job worker,
               bidirectional data/preflight migrator, and coolify-cli runtime
- executor/  — Rust workspace (coolify-executor) providing NDJSON streaming
               SSH/local execution, live PTY resize/stdin/cancel, whole-lifecycle
               timeouts, and host-boundary enforcement
- apps/web/  — Astro + Vue 3.5 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 frontend shell
- compose.yml, coolify.ps1, scripts/dev, docker/stack-migration/Dockerfile
  — Zero-PHP, zero-Node production container packaging and one-command launcher

